# ADR 0000: Record architecture decisions

Date: {{DATE}}
Status: accepted

## Context

{{PROJECT}} needs a record of each important decision and the reason for it. LLM sessions and people read it later, so that nobody decides the same thing twice.

## Decision

1. Each important decision is an ADR in `docs/adr/NNNN-short-title.md`, with Context, Decision, and Consequences.
2. An accepted ADR does not change. A new ADR supersedes it and names the part that it changes.
3. {{DECIDER}} accepts each ADR.

## Consequences

- The reasons for each choice stay in the repo, next to the code.
- A session can check a proposal against the ADRs before it builds.

## Template

```markdown
# ADR NNNN: <title>

Date: YYYY-MM-DD
Status: proposed | accepted | superseded by NNNN
Supersedes: <ADR and decision number, if any>

## Context
## Decision
## Consequences
```
